'' '#if' arithmetic is 64-bit: an unsuffixed literal past 64 bits, which is int128 in code
'' (lexer/littype.tiko), is refused there (TKO0308) rather than saturated or wrapped. One that
'' fits 64 bits is untouched (line 5).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ast tests/diagnostics/src/int128-pp-literal.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: int128-pp-literal.bas(1,1): error TKO0308
'' EXPECT-OUT: int128-pp-literal.bas(3,1): error TKO0308
'' EXPECT-NOT: (5,1): error
